# Blueprint-First Research with Expanded Prompts & Premium Presentation

This document contains the definitive, highly detailed technical specification and implementation plan for the Blueprint-First Research pipeline. It covers prompt expansion (to prevent summarization), cross-questioning verbatim transcripts, async source fanning, and a premium HTML/PDF/DOCX presentation layer.

---

## 🚀 Architectural Overview

```mermaid
graph TD
    Q[User Raw Query] --> CQ[Cross-Questioning Loop]
    CQ --> |Verbatim Transcript| PE[Prompt Expander]
    PE --> |Expanded Master Prompt| BP[Blueprint Generator]
    PE --> |Vectors & Authority Domains| SD[Source Discovery Pool]
    
    BP --> |blueprint.json| SPQ[Shared Priority Queue]
    SD --> |Deduplicated URLs| SPQ
    
    SPQ --> |pop highest priority| SC[Async Scraper Workers]
    SC --> |raw markdown + images| CC[Content Cache]
    
    CC --> |fan-out| ROUTE[AI URL Router]
    ROUTE --> |Heading Tagging| H_ACC[Heading-Level Accumulators]
    
    H_ACC --> |Saturated?| SYN[Blueprint-Aware Section Synthesizer]
    H_ACC --> |Hungry?| REDISC[Adaptive Re-Discovery]
    REDISC --> |new targeted URLs| SPQ
    
    SYN --> |Stream Markdown + Assets| PRES[Premium Presentation Engine]
    PRES --> |Jinja2 / CSS / JS| HTML[Premium report.html]
    PRES --> |python-docx / ReportLab| DOCS[report.docx / report.pdf]
```

